- `mask::rwx` — Mask allows all named entries full permissions
- `other::---` — No access for others

**Default ACLs (inherited by new files/subdirectories):**
- `default:user:alice:rwx` — Alice inherits full access on new items
- `default:user:bob:rwx` — Bob inherits full access on new items
- `default:group:research:rwx` — Research group inherits full access
- `default:mask::rwx` — Mask allows full inherited permissions
- `default:other::---` — Others get no access on new items

